Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:01.83,Say,,0,0,0,,Everybody plants a tree.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.50,0:00:04.45,Say,,0,0,0,,Nobody finds out what happened to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:05.54,0:00:06.30,Say,,0,0,0,,A birthday.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.34,0:00:07.38,Say,,0,0,0,,A school drive.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.42,0:00:08.82,Say,,0,0,0,,A company afternoon.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.11,0:00:11.84,Say,,0,0,0,,They plant it, they take the photo, they post it,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.88,0:00:13.31,Say,,0,0,0,,and that is where it ends.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.63,0:00:15.27,Say,,0,0,0,,The planting is an event.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:15.31,0:00:17.15,Say,,0,0,0,,The keeping alive is a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.82,0:00:19.25,Say,,0,0,0,,So how much of it lives?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.29,0:00:21.76,Say,,0,0,0,,India's national auditor went and looked.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.15,0:00:24.67,Say,,0,0,0,,Of a two point eight million hectare target,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.71,0:00:26.53,Say,,0,0,0,,about five percent was achieved.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.92,0:00:28.80,Say,,0,0,0,,At seventy percent of the sites,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.84,0:00:30.96,Say,,0,0,0,,no improvement in tree cover at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.35,0:00:33.89,Say,,0,0,0,,One site reported two thousand plantings.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.93,0:00:35.02,Say,,0,0,0,,Thirty were found.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.06,0:00:36.15,Say,,0,0,0,,None had survived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.17,0:00:39.41,Say,,0,0,0,,And here is the part that explains the rest.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:39.80,0:00:42.97,Say,,0,0,0,,Four out of five plantation records did not say what was
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.01,0:00:45.55,Say,,0,0,0,,planted, where it stood, or whether it lived.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.15,0:00:48.27,Say,,0,0,0,,Nobody was ever asked to keep one.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.31,0:00:50.12,Say,,0,0,0,,Planting is not the solution.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:50.16,0:00:51.39,Say,,0,0,0,,Keeping it alive is.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.34,0:00:55.01,Say,,0,0,0,,And we already pay people to do boring things.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:55.33,0:00:58.29,Say,,0,0,0,,Pay a credit card bill on time, and you earn points.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.61,0:01:00.51,Say,,0,0,0,,Water the tree you planted last year,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.55,0:01:01.93,Say,,0,0,0,,and nothing happens at all.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.81,0:01:04.86,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted pays you for keeping it alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.25,0:01:06.51,Say,,0,0,0,,Register a plant once.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:06.55,0:01:09.84,Say,,0,0,0,,Do the small jobs it needs, photographed as you do them.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.16,0:01:12.40,Say,,0,0,0,,You do not have to know anything about the plant.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:12.72,0:01:14.87,Say,,0,0,0,,Every plant carries its own coordinates,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.91,0:01:17.50,Say,,0,0,0,,and the schedule moves with the weather over it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.82,0:01:19.91,Say,,0,0,0,,Rain pushes the next watering out.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.95,0:01:20.98,Say,,0,0,0,,Heat pulls it in.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:21.65,0:01:23.18,Say,,0,0,0,,So nobody has to babysit it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:23.22,0:01:25.54,Say,,0,0,0,,It tells you the job on the day it is due.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.93,0:01:28.33,Say,,0,0,0,,Water, on this species own interval,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:28.37,0:01:30.43,Say,,0,0,0,,moved by the rain and the heat.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.75,0:01:34.11,Say,,0,0,0,,Feeding, with what this plant wants, and less than you think,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:34.15,0:01:37.57,Say,,0,0,0,,because what the roots do not take ends up in the groundwater.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.89,0:01:40.58,Say,,0,0,0,,Pests, with what goes wrong with this species,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.62,0:01:42.53,Say,,0,0,0,,and the mildest thing that works.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:42.85,0:01:45.02,Say,,0,0,0,,And a weekly look while it establishes,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.06,0:01:47.35,Say,,0,0,0,,which is when losing it is least visible.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.09,0:01:50.33,Say,,0,0,0,,Every plant also carries a health score.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.65,0:01:53.09,Say,,0,0,0,,Thriving, steady, watch it, at risk,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:53.13,0:01:55.72,Say,,0,0,0,,and one sentence saying what moved it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.11,0:01:59.01,Say,,0,0,0,,It does not read the leaves and call the plant sick.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:59.05,0:02:00.87,Say,,0,0,0,,A yellow leaf has a dozen causes.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.61,0:02:04.43,Say,,0,0,0,,The camera then tells you what would make the shot pass.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.75,0:02:05.27,Say,,0,0,0,,Out loud,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.31,0:02:08.76,Say,,0,0,0,,because whoever is doing this is holding a watering can.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.08,0:02:12.10,Say,,0,0,0,,It reads the frame twice a second, on the phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.14,0:02:13.24,Say,,0,0,0,,uploading nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:13.56,0:02:16.01,Say,,0,0,0,,Tilt down so the soil is in frame.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.05,0:02:17.91,Say,,0,0,0,,Then the ring turns green.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.65,0:02:21.90,Say,,0,0,0,,Then it is checked, and every check says the number it measured.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.22,0:02:23.51,Say,,0,0,0,,It came off the camera.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:23.55,0:02:24.49,Say,,0,0,0,,The time is ours.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.53,0:02:27.56,Say,,0,0,0,,The location matches where this plant was registered.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.88,0:02:31.84,Say,,0,0,0,,And soil five percent darker than that plant's own dry baseline.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:31.88,0:02:33.21,Say,,0,0,0,,Measured, not guessed.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:33.95,0:02:35.45,Say,,0,0,0,,This is the one that matters.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.49,0:02:38.74,Say,,0,0,0,,If any plant earned points, the points would be worth nothing.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.13,0:02:42.23,Say,,0,0,0,,So OpenCV matches keypoints against the plant's first
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.27,0:02:45.62,Say,,0,0,0,,photograph, and asks whether they agree on one viewpoint.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.94,0:02:48.61,Say,,0,0,0,,The same plant returns four hundred and eighty five.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.07,0:02:52.67,Say,,0,0,0,,A different plant of the same species, in a similar pot,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.71,0:02:53.52,Say,,0,0,0,,returns four.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.68,0:02:58.14,Say,,0,0,0,,Registering a plant checks the photograph before it accepts it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:58.46,0:03:00.62,Say,,0,0,0,,Point it at a notebook and it says so.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.66,0:03:03.04,Say,,0,0,0,,An object scores nought point two percent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.08,0:03:05.07,Say,,0,0,0,,The weakest real plant scored nine.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:05.46,0:03:08.26,Say,,0,0,0,,Point it at a plant and it works out what it is.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.30,0:03:10.99,Say,,0,0,0,,Seventy-eight species, searched by local name.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:11.31,0:03:13.53,Say,,0,0,0,,The whole premise is that people forget.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:13.57,0:03:15.39,Say,,0,0,0,,So this cannot wait to be opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:15.78,0:03:19.65,Say,,0,0,0,,When a task comes due, the same message goes out on WhatsApp,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:19.69,0:03:20.62,Say,,0,0,0,,email and text.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.94,0:03:24.01,Say,,0,0,0,,A name, a plant and a date go to the server.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:24.05,0:03:26.20,Say,,0,0,0,,No photographs, no coordinates.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:27.01,0:03:29.61,Say,,0,0,0,,Organisations spend heavily on planting drives,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:29.65,0:03:31.79,Say,,0,0,0,,and get back a photograph from day one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:32.18,0:03:34.92,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted produces the record of what survived,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.96,0:03:37.64,Say,,0,0,0,,every point traceable to one verified task.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.03,0:03:39.72,Say,,0,0,0,,That record funds the rewards.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.76,0:03:41.15,Say,,0,0,0,,The offers are stand-ins,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.19,0:03:44.66,Say,,0,0,0,,because naming a real company would put words in their mouth.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:48.31,Say,,0,0,0,,Two things did not survive contact with a measurement.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.70,0:03:51.22,Say,,0,0,0,,I tried to work out the species on the device.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.26,0:03:54.11,Say,,0,0,0,,It got the right answer zero times out of seventeen.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.50,0:03:57.44,Say,,0,0,0,,And the identity check used to compare brightness grids.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:57.48,0:03:59.88,Say,,0,0,0,,A different neem tree walked straight through.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.27,0:04:02.06,Say,,0,0,0,,Against eight percent for guessing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.10,0:04:05.13,Say,,0,0,0,,It was the weakest thing in the app wearing the name of the
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.17,0:04:06.69,Say,,0,0,0,,strongest, so it was replaced.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.71,0:04:09.69,Say,,0,0,0,,We reward people for spending money.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:10.50,0:04:13.02,Say,,0,0,0,,Rooted rewards them for keeping something alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.18,0:04:14.84,Say,,0,0,0,,Plant it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.88,0:04:15.47,Say,,0,0,0,,Keep it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:15.51,0:04:16.71,Say,,0,0,0,,Get paid for it.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.45,0:04:20.15,Say,,0,0,0,,Nothing in here reports a number it did not measure.
